WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
<v Instructor>Welcome to this comprehensive lesson on advanced Next.js layouts and templates.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.200
Today we are going to explore how layouts preserve state across navigation while templates re-instantiate their component tree.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.500
[Applause] In typical production applications, layouts are the right choice 95% of the time.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.400
However, when you need to record page views with an analytics library or reset an animation on every transition, templates are essential.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Let us look at how the file structure is organized inside the app folder.
